WEBVTT

01:35.910 --> 01:40.789
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.440 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 19]

02:00.310 --> 02:01.000
Mister,

02:01.560 --> 02:02.000
do you know

02:02.000 --> 02:03.860
who's the owner of this carriage?

02:03.950 --> 02:04.610
Who are you?

02:11.710 --> 02:12.120
This carriage

02:12.120 --> 02:13.280
belongs to Miss Ruyan.

02:13.280 --> 02:15.340
We just brought her back not long ago.

02:15.870 --> 02:17.730
Which young master sent you here?

02:19.000 --> 02:20.200
Please go and tell him

02:20.680 --> 02:22.000
Miss Ruyan has just left
and that she won't be back

02:22.000 --> 02:22.930
until tomorrow.

02:45.860 --> 02:46.500
[Ruyan]

02:46.950 --> 02:48.390
[Ruyan]

02:50.000 --> 02:51.870
[Ruyan]

03:20.020 --> 03:20.750
Here you are.

03:21.270 --> 03:22.800
Thank you, Sister Xueying.

03:26.170 --> 03:27.740
It turns out that looking from this spot,

03:27.740 --> 03:28.910
one can see everything

03:28.910 --> 03:30.170
on the street clearly.

03:31.030 --> 03:32.400
Was Wu Ying's appearance that day

03:32.400 --> 03:33.460
not a random event?

03:33.790 --> 03:34.990
Two bowls of noodles.

03:35.150 --> 03:37.680
She seemed to be waiting for someone
that day.

03:38.150 --> 03:40.210
Was it that maid from the dance house?

04:04.190 --> 04:04.800
Sister,

04:05.260 --> 04:06.580
where did you go just now?

04:06.580 --> 04:07.630
What happened?

04:08.870 --> 04:09.490
Nothing.

04:10.280 --> 04:10.960
Are the kids

04:10.960 --> 04:11.790
all full?

04:12.710 --> 04:14.560
They made a competition out of the eating.

04:14.560 --> 04:15.480
After you left,

04:15.500 --> 04:17.630
I bought them one more bowl of noodles.

04:17.720 --> 04:18.779
They ate that much?

04:20.000 --> 04:20.870
Kids, when we're back,

04:20.870 --> 04:21.870
you'll practice the horse stance.

04:21.870 --> 04:24.530
No sleep until you hold the stance
for two hours.

04:26.000 --> 04:26.720
Master,

04:26.800 --> 04:27.580
is it too late to spew up

04:27.580 --> 04:28.920
-the noodles now?
-Master...

04:28.920 --> 04:29.970
Master, I'll spew them out too.

04:29.970 --> 04:31.630
Me as well.

04:31.650 --> 04:32.740
It's too late.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.360
How can you sleep when you're stuffed?

04:34.360 --> 04:35.120
Master...

04:35.120 --> 04:37.380
Stop whining, or I'll make it four hours.

04:39.159 --> 04:39.720
Xueying,

04:40.040 --> 04:41.560
are you familiar with Yujing City?

04:41.560 --> 04:42.960
I'm looking for a smithy.

04:44.870 --> 04:47.200
There seems to be one
next to the pharmacy.

04:54.409 --> 04:59.230
[Wutong Mansion]

04:56.510 --> 04:57.040
Come out.

04:57.390 --> 04:57.870
Come on.

05:00.040 --> 05:00.600
Slowly.

05:05.850 --> 05:06.660
Miss Yixiao.

05:07.870 --> 05:08.600
You're back.

05:10.310 --> 05:11.510
What happened to you?

05:13.070 --> 05:15.130
Seems like someone lashed out at you.

05:15.160 --> 05:16.000
Did the First Prince get mad

05:16.000 --> 05:17.070
because

05:17.430 --> 05:19.290
Sister and I went out for a stroll?

05:19.360 --> 05:20.960
I'm fine, all safe and sound.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.370
Is he back?

05:24.160 --> 05:26.360
His Highness is waiting for you inside.

05:33.950 --> 05:35.570
-Brother!
-Brother!

05:36.750 --> 05:37.470
Brother!

05:38.190 --> 05:38.920
Brother,

05:39.060 --> 05:40.310
can I go to your armory again

05:40.310 --> 05:41.000
for a visit?

05:41.310 --> 05:42.090
Yes, sure.

05:42.270 --> 05:43.610
Pick whatever you like.

05:43.750 --> 05:45.220
Take them to the armory.

05:45.360 --> 05:47.070
Keep them safe from the sharp weapons.

05:47.070 --> 05:47.720
Yes.

05:47.920 --> 05:48.920
Thank you, Brother.

05:48.920 --> 05:49.520
Off you go.

05:49.680 --> 05:50.210
Let's go.

05:50.240 --> 05:51.190
I'll give you a tour!

05:51.190 --> 05:52.450
There are many weapons in the armory!

05:52.450 --> 05:52.980
Let's go!

06:09.190 --> 06:10.250
What's this about?

06:11.120 --> 06:12.850
I'm a third wheel now, aren't I?

06:12.950 --> 06:14.240
You could've just said it out.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.430
I'd know my cue to leave.

06:15.430 --> 06:15.870
Nine,

06:16.270 --> 06:16.800
let's go.

06:22.700 --> 06:23.630
Anything wrong?

06:24.400 --> 06:25.800
What exactly happened?

06:27.390 --> 06:28.590
His Majesty got sick,

06:29.040 --> 06:30.310
and is now in a coma.

06:31.030 --> 06:32.159
But don't you worry.

06:32.680 --> 06:33.270
Lord Ling

06:33.560 --> 06:35.120
is attending to His Majesty in the palace.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.920
I'm actually worried about you.

06:37.070 --> 06:38.800
His Majesty suddenly fell ill.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.200
One can safely assume

06:40.360 --> 06:41.750
that things in Yujing City

06:41.750 --> 06:43.610
will soon become unpredictable.

06:43.800 --> 06:44.930
As the First Prince,

06:45.600 --> 06:46.630
you're about to be

06:46.920 --> 06:48.120
dragged into danger.

06:53.650 --> 06:55.110
Under any circumstances,

06:55.480 --> 06:56.360
keeping yourself safe

06:56.360 --> 06:57.530
is the top priority.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.190
Got it?

07:02.390 --> 07:02.990
Oh, right.

07:03.480 --> 07:05.080
I want to tell you something.

07:05.430 --> 07:06.600
So do I.

07:07.120 --> 07:07.920
You go first.

07:11.270 --> 07:12.480
Are you going to blame me

07:12.480 --> 07:14.070
for going out without guards?

07:14.070 --> 07:15.040
It's true that my hand is injured,

07:15.040 --> 07:16.310
but I don't have disabilities.

07:16.310 --> 07:18.110
Please don't make a fuss over it.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.760
What were you trying to tell me just now?

07:33.000 --> 07:34.530
Take Fang and the kids away.

07:35.120 --> 07:37.450
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

07:37.240 --> 07:38.390
Go back to Zhengnian Villa

07:37.909 --> 07:40.790
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

07:38.950 --> 07:40.409
with Young Mistress Ling.

07:41.140 --> 07:42.159
My father is seriously ill.

07:41.190 --> 07:43.470
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

07:42.310 --> 07:44.070
Prime Minister Zhuang
will take over the court soon.

07:44.070 --> 07:47.510
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

07:44.390 --> 07:44.850
By then,

07:44.870 --> 07:46.920
he'll wield immense power
with control of all the six ministries.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.390
I'm worried that they might go after you,

07:47.960 --> 07:50.130
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

07:48.870 --> 07:50.330
because they're aware...

07:50.590 --> 07:54.210
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

07:51.659 --> 07:53.520
that you're my biggest weakness.

07:54.630 --> 08:00.310
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

08:00.680 --> 08:02.160
Nothing in my life can be my weakness,

08:00.740 --> 08:02.680
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

08:03.240 --> 08:04.160
except for Xiyang

08:03.340 --> 08:06.910
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

08:04.870 --> 08:05.870
and you.

08:07.300 --> 08:09.050
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

08:07.510 --> 08:09.310
I already failed to protect Xiyang.

08:09.310 --> 08:09.920
There is no way I'll let you...

08:09.480 --> 08:13.140
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

08:09.920 --> 08:10.360
Okay.

08:12.240 --> 08:13.300
I'll do as you said.

08:13.690 --> 08:15.690
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

08:14.560 --> 08:15.820
You've agreed to that?

08:16.160 --> 08:19.200
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

08:16.570 --> 08:18.170
Does it look like I'm joking?

08:19.750 --> 08:25.140
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

08:20.160 --> 08:20.780
Yixiao,

08:21.470 --> 08:23.470
I didn't mean to be so blunt about it.

08:24.190 --> 08:25.440
On my way back,

08:25.510 --> 08:26.120
I was thinking

08:26.120 --> 08:27.780
how to put it diplomatically.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.940
But being pressed for time,

08:28.940 --> 08:30.160
I had to react fast.

08:30.510 --> 08:31.310
I understand.

08:31.750 --> 08:33.610
It's good to be straightforward.

08:33.669 --> 08:35.080
I was planning to leave anyway.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.280
Now, this is perfect.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.090
What were you going to tell me earlier?

08:41.630 --> 08:42.720
It doesn't matter now.

08:42.720 --> 08:43.450
Don't worry.

08:44.150 --> 08:45.950
Just focus on what you need to do.

08:47.790 --> 08:48.410
Master!

08:48.670 --> 08:49.840
Shunzi, Fang,

08:50.390 --> 08:51.360
go get Sister Xueying.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.440
We need to pack up our stuff quickly.

08:52.440 --> 08:53.900
We're leaving right away.

08:53.910 --> 08:54.790
Why so surprised?

08:54.790 --> 08:55.990
Go start packing now.

08:57.120 --> 08:58.650
You're leaving right away?

08:59.030 --> 09:00.230
The clock is ticking.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.030
I would hate to be a burden

09:02.630 --> 09:03.830
or a liability to you.

09:05.200 --> 09:05.550
Go.

09:06.080 --> 09:06.390
Be quick.

09:06.390 --> 09:06.990
Master...

09:07.870 --> 09:08.670
What are you waiting for?

09:08.670 --> 09:09.670
No more dawdling.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.600
Fang, keep up!

09:10.600 --> 09:11.000
Yes!

09:16.790 --> 09:17.480
Yixiao.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.440
Yixiao!

09:21.120 --> 09:22.910
Fang told me you would leave soon.

09:22.910 --> 09:23.630
That's right.

09:23.630 --> 09:24.270
Not only I,

09:24.600 --> 09:26.120
but also Nine, Fang, Shunzi, and you

09:26.120 --> 09:26.870
will be leaving.

09:26.870 --> 09:27.930
I have to leave too?

09:28.270 --> 09:28.750
Yes.

09:30.330 --> 09:34.110
[Wutong Mansion]

10:05.390 --> 10:06.120
Come with me.

10:06.840 --> 10:07.320
What happened?

10:07.320 --> 10:07.920
Just come!

10:11.270 --> 10:12.000
Your Highness,

10:12.000 --> 10:12.460
Miss Yixiao

10:12.460 --> 10:13.440
is leaving with those kids.

10:13.440 --> 10:14.750
Their carriage is at the door now.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.120
We can still catch up with them.

10:16.120 --> 10:17.000
The city gate will be closed soon.

10:17.000 --> 10:18.030
We have to set out now,
or they'll be gone!

10:18.030 --> 10:18.630
Hands off!

10:24.150 --> 10:24.840
Yun Fang,

10:25.030 --> 10:25.750
Send two guards

10:25.750 --> 10:26.670
to escort them.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.410
Tell the guys to lay low.

10:29.670 --> 10:32.270
Yujing City is facing
many uncertainties now.

10:32.320 --> 10:34.450
They won't be safe until they're away.

10:35.870 --> 10:36.270
Yes.

10:37.240 --> 10:39.170
I hope Miss Yixiao will understand

10:39.200 --> 10:41.800
what Your Highness's efforts are for
someday.

10:45.130 --> 10:47.640
[Wutong Mansion]

10:50.140 --> 10:57.170
[Wutong Mansion]

11:39.330 --> 11:40.390
It wasn't until they camped at night

11:40.390 --> 11:41.000
did I notice

11:41.000 --> 11:42.230
Miss Yixiao was nowhere to be seen.

11:42.230 --> 11:43.240
She must have secretly

11:43.240 --> 11:44.400
gotten off the carriage halfway.

11:44.400 --> 11:45.230
Your Highness,

11:45.230 --> 11:46.360
it seems Miss Yixiao and her fellows

11:46.360 --> 11:47.960
didn't leave the city at all.

11:48.000 --> 11:50.200
What about Miss Ling and the children?

11:50.340 --> 11:50.960
I've already sent people

11:50.960 --> 11:52.200
to continue protecting them,

11:52.200 --> 11:52.790
to make sure

11:52.790 --> 11:54.990
they arrive at Zhengnian Villa safely.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.390
Why don't I have some people

11:56.390 --> 11:57.720
go look for Miss Yixiao?

11:58.150 --> 11:58.770
No need.

11:59.360 --> 12:01.090
Do you know where she was off to?

12:01.810 --> 12:03.210
How am I supposed to know?

12:03.630 --> 12:05.310
Are we not going to look for her?

12:05.310 --> 12:06.640
If anyone asks about her,

12:06.640 --> 12:07.770
just tell them this—

12:07.970 --> 12:09.840
Fu Yixiao has gone
with Young Mistress Ling

12:09.840 --> 12:11.060
to Zhengnian Villa.

12:14.790 --> 12:15.450
-Yes.
-Yes.

12:27.550 --> 12:28.180
Sir.

12:57.270 --> 12:57.750
Sir,

12:58.000 --> 12:58.550
no one else

12:58.550 --> 13:00.010
has seen this mask, right?

13:00.080 --> 13:00.910
You specifically asked me

13:00.910 --> 13:01.720
to keep it secret.

13:01.720 --> 13:02.440
Rest assured.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.370
I know the rules.

13:06.660 --> 13:09.950
[Lotus Pavilion]

13:07.270 --> 13:08.390
Sir, please come in.

13:08.390 --> 13:09.750
Sir, to the second floor.

13:09.750 --> 13:10.720
Come this way.

13:12.080 --> 13:12.840
Sir, careful.

13:12.380 --> 13:15.210
[Lotus Pavilion]

13:12.870 --> 13:13.850
Come visit us again!

13:13.850 --> 13:14.600
Come visit us again!

13:14.600 --> 13:15.510
Mr. Wang!

13:16.790 --> 13:18.200
Gentlemen, come on in.

13:18.870 --> 13:19.550
Miss Ruyan!

13:19.550 --> 13:20.390
Miss Ruyan!

13:20.550 --> 13:21.610
Hello, Miss Ruyan.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.170
These gentlemen

13:23.200 --> 13:25.080
have been waiting here since yesterday.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.390
Too bad that they haven't realized

13:26.390 --> 13:27.030
not everyone

13:27.030 --> 13:28.510
gets to see you dance.

13:30.200 --> 13:30.600
Oh, right.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.290
A lady just came to the dance house,

13:32.290 --> 13:33.620
asking to meet with you.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.420
A lady?

13:37.000 --> 13:37.790
However,

13:37.960 --> 13:38.720
I don't know

13:38.720 --> 13:39.740
where she is now.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.120
Miss, you do

13:58.150 --> 13:59.790
recognize this mask.

14:01.630 --> 14:04.460
W-What an unconventional mask.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.510
Is it yours?

14:06.870 --> 14:08.080
After the Battle of Pingling,

14:08.080 --> 14:09.510
someone took your carriage

14:09.510 --> 14:11.110
to the Jinxiu military camp.

14:11.360 --> 14:12.560
Do you remember that?

14:14.270 --> 14:15.800
What are you talking about?

14:16.230 --> 14:17.360
I don't understand.

14:17.750 --> 14:18.470
You don't?

14:30.150 --> 14:31.270
That day, you had that girl

14:31.270 --> 14:33.320
go to the back alley to deliver a note.

14:33.320 --> 14:35.320
She also read what was written on it.

14:35.360 --> 14:37.160
"Stand by outside Yujing City."

14:37.300 --> 14:38.630
Why would the death camp

14:38.720 --> 14:40.200
follow your orders?

14:42.480 --> 14:44.010
Miss, you must be mistaken.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.420
What "death camp"?

14:45.720 --> 14:47.510
I'm just a dancer.

14:47.530 --> 14:48.730
Still in denial, huh?

14:48.870 --> 14:50.530
That girl already confessed.

14:54.830 --> 14:55.840
Tell me

14:55.840 --> 14:57.040
everything you know.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.960
Or I won't be nice to you.

15:01.270 --> 15:03.260
I've told you I know nothing!

15:04.550 --> 15:06.080
You just won't tell, right?

15:06.130 --> 15:07.750
Then there's no choice

15:08.310 --> 15:09.870
but to talk somewhere else.

15:31.120 --> 15:31.750
As I said,

15:31.790 --> 15:32.720
I know nothing.

15:33.270 --> 15:34.670
Abducting me won't help.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.800
Kill me, if you have the guts.

16:04.080 --> 16:04.940
You want to die?

16:07.150 --> 16:08.350
I'll grant your wish.

16:12.800 --> 16:13.750
Not there.

16:16.720 --> 16:17.720
Aim for this spot.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.850
Slit it with all your strength.

16:21.850 --> 16:24.250
The pain will disappear within an instant.

16:24.710 --> 16:27.570
You'll only feel extremely cold
all over your body.

16:27.900 --> 16:29.230
Then you'll get drowsy.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.520
Very sleepy, I'd say.

16:32.670 --> 16:33.600
Ending a life...

16:34.070 --> 16:35.180
is actually easier

16:35.600 --> 16:36.550
than it sounds.

16:43.120 --> 16:43.650
What now?

16:44.360 --> 16:45.600
Can't bring yourself to do it?

16:45.600 --> 16:46.510
Then don't pretend

16:46.510 --> 16:47.510
not to fear death.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.150
After all, nothing can be

16:49.150 --> 16:50.520
more important than staying alive.

16:50.520 --> 16:51.450
Don't you agree?

16:52.960 --> 16:53.690
I've told you

16:53.720 --> 16:54.670
I know nothing.

16:54.750 --> 16:56.470
I did have a note delivered,

16:56.540 --> 16:57.440
but I really didn't know

16:57.440 --> 16:58.270
the content.

16:58.510 --> 16:59.870
Also, I don't understand

16:59.870 --> 17:01.720
a single word of what you just said.

17:01.720 --> 17:03.580
Did he ask you to deliver the note?

17:08.589 --> 17:09.550
I'm curious.

17:10.310 --> 17:12.310
What's your relationship with him?

17:12.880 --> 17:14.079
All you need to know is

17:15.069 --> 17:16.599
that I'll never betray him.

17:17.160 --> 17:17.960
I'd rather die

17:18.920 --> 17:20.000
than sell him out.

17:20.790 --> 17:22.310
Such admirable loyalty.

17:22.510 --> 17:24.270
You're so devoted to him.

17:24.270 --> 17:25.599
Are you in love with him?

17:26.720 --> 17:27.450
Look at you,

17:27.480 --> 17:28.440
completely lovestruck.

17:28.440 --> 17:29.970
You defend him all the time.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.200
I guess I'm right.

17:31.350 --> 17:32.750
I won't tell you who he is.

17:33.110 --> 17:35.770
Don't waste your time
fishing for information.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.820
The news of you being abducted

17:39.030 --> 17:39.750
will soon

17:39.790 --> 17:41.590
spread throughout Yujing City.

17:42.110 --> 17:43.040
Venture a guess.

17:43.240 --> 17:45.640
Will that man you fancy
come to your rescue?

17:48.160 --> 17:49.440
You don't seem to be sure

17:49.440 --> 17:51.200
whether he truly cares about you or not.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.060
How about this?

17:52.240 --> 17:53.170
let's make a bet,

17:53.510 --> 17:55.110
on whether he'll come or not.

17:55.270 --> 17:56.670
He... He won't come here.

17:57.200 --> 17:57.850
He's well aware

17:57.850 --> 17:58.750
that I'll never betray him.

17:58.750 --> 17:59.750
I bet he will come,

18:00.110 --> 18:01.550
though not in person.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.520
Instead, he'll send someone

18:05.400 --> 18:06.480
to kill you.

18:18.590 --> 18:19.720
That's impossible.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.330
He won't do that.

18:21.680 --> 18:23.340
Whether you betray him or not,

18:23.630 --> 18:25.130
he'll silence you permanently—

18:25.130 --> 18:27.070
he even doesn't need to do it himself

18:27.070 --> 18:28.480
—because only your death

18:28.920 --> 18:30.920
can guarantee there won't be witnesses,

18:30.920 --> 18:33.050
and that his plans won't be sabotaged.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.170
It can't be true.

18:34.750 --> 18:36.080
He won't have me killed.

18:36.350 --> 18:37.550
You don't believe it?

18:38.200 --> 18:39.240
Then wait and see.

18:40.510 --> 18:42.440
Actually, I deliberately left clues.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.980
I purposefully used your carriage

18:43.980 --> 18:45.070
to bring you here.

18:45.790 --> 18:47.110
Following the carriage tracks,

18:47.110 --> 18:48.310
he'll find this place.

18:48.310 --> 18:50.370
If he doesn't send anyone to kill you,

18:50.440 --> 18:51.700
then I'll set you free.

18:51.720 --> 18:52.640
And I promise to never give you

18:52.640 --> 18:53.970
a difficult time again.

18:54.070 --> 18:55.790
But if things turn out as I said,

18:55.790 --> 18:57.350
you must tell me everything

18:57.480 --> 18:58.270
you know.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.160
Shall we bet on it?

19:17.880 --> 19:19.510
My Lord, you're His Eminence's ally.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.110
May I ask

19:20.510 --> 19:22.510
if His Eminence has safely escaped?

19:22.590 --> 19:24.190
I think he has ordered you all

19:24.510 --> 19:26.040
to do my bidding from now on.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.030
I have one rule here—

19:28.590 --> 19:30.310
you are only to execute my orders,

19:30.310 --> 19:31.910
and not to ask any questions.

19:32.550 --> 19:33.000
Yes.

19:34.070 --> 19:35.680
My Lord, previously, you asked us

19:35.680 --> 19:37.480
to stand by outside Yujing City.

19:37.510 --> 19:39.770
All the members of the death camp are here

19:39.790 --> 19:40.920
at your service now.

19:41.830 --> 19:43.160
You will find it worthwhile

19:43.160 --> 19:44.560
to risk your lives for me.

19:44.640 --> 19:46.670
When my great mission is accomplished,

19:46.670 --> 19:48.670
you'll all have a share of the glory.

19:48.960 --> 19:49.760
Now, your task

19:50.510 --> 19:52.510
is to kill a person for me.

20:00.350 --> 20:01.210
Your Highness.

20:01.720 --> 20:03.920
Here's a message from Grandmaster Ling:

20:03.920 --> 20:05.590
His Majesty has not yet come to.

20:05.590 --> 20:07.510
Neither has his condition worsened.

20:07.510 --> 20:10.310
Grandmaster Ling
wished you not to worry too much.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.110
I got it.

20:13.480 --> 20:15.140
Concerned about your health,

20:15.310 --> 20:17.160
he made a prescription for you
in particular.

20:17.160 --> 20:20.310
Please have Your Highness's physician
prepare the herbs.

20:20.310 --> 20:20.880
Thanks.

20:26.100 --> 20:29.120
[Licorice roots: 5 grams; Steamed rehmannia roots: 50 grams;
White atractylodes and Chinese angelicad: 25 grams each]

20:39.160 --> 20:40.020
Your Highness.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.880
There was a disturbance
at the dance house.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.790
A dancer named Ruyan

20:43.790 --> 20:44.650
was taken away.

20:44.920 --> 20:45.550
Ruyan?

20:49.590 --> 20:51.120
This must be related to her.

20:51.720 --> 20:52.200
To whom?

20:52.590 --> 20:53.510
Tomorrow, the authorities

20:53.510 --> 20:55.070
will surely search for Ruyan.

20:55.070 --> 20:56.390
Keep an eye on how it develops.

20:56.390 --> 20:58.590
Create some trouble for them in secret.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.210
Just do as I say.

21:02.270 --> 21:02.790
Got it.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.200
Miss, do you like any one of them?

21:13.680 --> 21:14.110
This one.

21:14.110 --> 21:14.680
Miss Ruyan

21:14.680 --> 21:16.070
was abducted by a young woman.

21:16.070 --> 21:17.000
You guys, search

21:17.030 --> 21:18.200
each household down the street!

21:18.200 --> 21:19.550
Bring all the women you find suspicious

21:19.550 --> 21:20.480
back to the office!

21:20.480 --> 21:21.140
-Yes!
-Yes!

21:22.120 --> 21:22.790
Miss, wait!

21:28.240 --> 21:29.300
What are you doing?

21:30.750 --> 21:31.410
Officer Lu,

21:32.070 --> 21:33.640
we're ordered by the prefect

21:33.640 --> 21:34.240
to investigate

21:34.240 --> 21:35.830
the abduction of Miss Ruyan.

21:35.830 --> 21:37.400
You're from the Capital Prefecture Office?

21:37.400 --> 21:37.830
Yes.

21:38.510 --> 21:39.550
The Capital Prefecture Office

21:39.550 --> 21:41.400
is responsible for maintaining order
in the capital.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.160
So instead of fulfilling

21:42.160 --> 21:43.240
your duties assigned by His Majesty,

21:43.240 --> 21:43.900
you chose to

21:43.920 --> 21:46.180
waste your time on such trivial matters?

21:47.350 --> 21:49.350
Here is the First Prince's command!

21:49.880 --> 21:50.880
All of you shall guard

21:50.880 --> 21:52.310
outside the imperial palace.

21:52.310 --> 21:53.290
Do not ask a single question

21:53.290 --> 21:54.270
about those trivial matters.

21:54.270 --> 21:55.070
Do you hear me?

21:55.350 --> 21:56.270
-Yes!
-Yes!

21:56.880 --> 21:57.790
Let's go!

22:07.830 --> 22:08.400
Your Highness,

22:08.400 --> 22:09.000
I've found

22:09.020 --> 22:10.420
the soldier who poisoned

22:10.440 --> 22:11.900
the war horses in our camp.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.380
However...

22:14.270 --> 22:15.350
He must be dead now.

22:17.030 --> 22:18.240
In the woods near our military camp,

22:18.240 --> 22:19.350
we discovered his body.

22:19.350 --> 22:20.000
In his tent,

22:20.000 --> 22:21.800
hidden silver taels were found.

22:21.880 --> 22:23.120
He was probably bribed

22:23.120 --> 22:24.050
and then killed.

22:25.070 --> 22:26.600
If my deduction is correct,

22:26.880 --> 22:28.920
this must be
Prime Minister Zhuang's doing.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.270
I'll go on with the investigation.

22:30.270 --> 22:30.960
If we can get something

22:30.960 --> 22:31.920
on him through this case...

22:31.920 --> 22:32.400
No need.

22:33.400 --> 22:35.240
Prime Minister Zhuang is a weasel.

22:35.240 --> 22:37.040
He already killed that soldier.

22:37.110 --> 22:38.880
There is no way he'd leave a trail behind.

22:38.880 --> 22:39.880
Your Highness...

22:42.070 --> 22:42.750
Your Highness,

22:42.750 --> 22:43.920
Shen Wu the Minister of Rites

22:43.920 --> 22:45.450
is requesting an audience.

22:47.060 --> 22:54.900
[Wutong Mansion]

22:51.640 --> 22:52.500
Your Highness,

22:53.440 --> 22:54.510
I was planning

22:54.510 --> 22:56.310
to go to Princess Xiyang's villa

22:56.350 --> 22:57.920
to check and cart the dowry

22:57.920 --> 22:58.850
prepared by Your Highness

22:58.850 --> 22:59.960
before transporting it to Jinxiu.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.030
Since

23:01.030 --> 23:03.750
Your Highness's supervision is needed
in this matter,

23:03.750 --> 23:06.630
I had to come and trouble Your Highness.

23:07.510 --> 23:08.570
Get my horse ready.

23:08.590 --> 23:09.540
I'm leaving for the villa.

23:09.540 --> 23:10.960
[Wutong Mansion]

23:10.110 --> 23:10.750
Yes.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.000
So,

23:13.160 --> 23:15.510
Your Highness is going to
monitor the process

23:15.510 --> 23:16.110
in person?

23:17.250 --> 23:19.550
That's wonderful!

23:33.670 --> 23:35.200
Ahead lies Shengjing City.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.200
Everyone, take a rest here!

23:37.310 --> 23:37.880
Yes!

24:02.830 --> 24:04.380
Lift up your head.

24:06.200 --> 24:07.550
Your father passed away

24:07.680 --> 24:08.510
before

24:08.510 --> 24:10.150
he could leave a will.

24:10.550 --> 24:12.830
Should I make you the emperor

24:13.310 --> 24:15.400
or let Jingyan take the throne?

24:18.640 --> 24:19.730
Mother,

24:20.510 --> 24:22.110
I'm devoid of the competence

24:23.270 --> 24:24.470
to assume the throne.

24:24.960 --> 24:26.920
But many court officials

24:26.920 --> 24:28.050
think highly of you.

24:29.270 --> 24:31.800
This has truly put me
in a difficult position.

24:33.610 --> 24:36.790
Since you've admitted to
not being qualified for the throne,

24:36.790 --> 24:38.520
I should kindly grant your wish

24:40.350 --> 24:41.960
of guarding Zhennan Pass

24:41.960 --> 24:43.350
in Pingling City.

24:43.960 --> 24:44.880
Off you go then.

25:14.510 --> 25:15.200
My Prince,

25:15.920 --> 25:17.270
when was the last time you came back

25:17.270 --> 25:18.330
to Shengjing City?

25:25.350 --> 25:26.210
A long time ago.

25:28.130 --> 25:29.330
Then I guess this trip

25:29.620 --> 25:31.750
will bring back many memories for you.

25:35.980 --> 25:37.380
Here's good news for you.

25:37.960 --> 25:39.760
Father praised you again today,

25:40.120 --> 25:41.790
saying that you're gifted, bright,

25:41.790 --> 25:43.250
and exceptionally smart,

25:43.640 --> 25:45.280
and that I lag far behind you.

25:46.820 --> 25:48.410
You're just a worthless wretch

25:48.410 --> 25:49.720
given birth by a lowly maid.

25:49.720 --> 25:51.580
Who are you to be compared with me?

26:09.870 --> 26:13.520
[Jingming Garden]

26:14.780 --> 26:16.440
Let me conduct one more check.

26:17.030 --> 26:19.240
Guys,
make sure you count every item right.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.350
Be extra careful!

26:20.720 --> 26:21.240
Yes.

26:28.730 --> 26:33.570
[Jingming Garden]

26:29.440 --> 26:30.700
Your Highness,

26:30.800 --> 26:32.430
here is the list of Princess Xiyang's

26:32.430 --> 26:33.430
dowry

26:33.480 --> 26:34.410
for your review.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.600
[List of Dowry]

26:38.720 --> 26:41.320
I watched Princess Xiyang

26:41.350 --> 26:42.350
grow up.

26:42.780 --> 26:45.310
Seeing Her Highness leaving Susha,

26:45.330 --> 26:46.350
I felt like

26:46.370 --> 26:47.900
there was a void in my heart.

26:48.680 --> 26:49.680
As the verse goes,

26:49.920 --> 26:52.590
"the royal abode stands silent
in the wind;

26:52.610 --> 26:55.340
nobody responds to the rain
in the bamboo groove;

26:55.610 --> 26:57.720
[Jingming Garden]

26:55.880 --> 26:58.720
the gone princess is not to be
heard or seen;

26:59.030 --> 27:02.830
though a thousand miles apart,
we watch the same moon over the roof."

27:03.840 --> 27:05.720
Xiyang is all by herself.

27:06.200 --> 27:07.400
She must feel lonely.

27:07.880 --> 27:09.140
Go make arrangements.

27:09.240 --> 27:11.100
Send Xiyang's maids and servants

27:11.440 --> 27:13.300
to Jinxiu along with the dowry.

27:15.110 --> 27:15.790
Your Highness,

27:15.790 --> 27:17.270
if there's nothing wrong about the list,

27:17.270 --> 27:18.510
I'll load the dowry into the carts.

27:18.510 --> 27:19.040
Go ahead.

27:20.020 --> 27:22.430
[Jingming Garden]

27:20.880 --> 27:22.100
Check one more time.

27:22.240 --> 27:24.030
Cart the items if everything's alright.

27:24.030 --> 27:24.760
Get a move on.

27:25.510 --> 27:26.160
Your Highness,

27:26.160 --> 27:27.200
here's a message from Song Cheng.

27:27.200 --> 27:27.830
Trails of those people

27:27.830 --> 27:29.430
were found outside the city.

28:40.180 --> 28:41.510
There's an ambush. Run!

28:55.480 --> 28:57.610
You recognize those women, don't you?

29:01.070 --> 29:03.730
You've seen for yourself.
I was right, wasn't I?

29:05.880 --> 29:07.010
Spill the beans now.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.400
I did lose the bet.

29:10.590 --> 29:11.750
But I still won't tell you

29:11.750 --> 29:12.480
who I'm working for.

29:12.480 --> 29:13.620
At this point,

29:13.920 --> 29:15.550
you're still protecting him?

29:15.550 --> 29:16.950
He attempted to kill you.

29:17.110 --> 29:19.170
Yet you still choose to cover for him?

29:20.510 --> 29:21.640
I'm just a dancer.

29:22.590 --> 29:24.050
How could you take the word

29:24.510 --> 29:26.310
of a member of the debased caste?

29:26.840 --> 29:28.100
Nobody would ever miss

29:29.790 --> 29:30.590
someone like me,

29:30.590 --> 29:31.800
even if I died.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.160
Kill me now.

29:39.350 --> 29:40.950
I knew you'd break your word.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.900
But it doesn't matter.

29:43.310 --> 29:44.070
I can still

29:44.590 --> 29:46.590
find out who he is without your help.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.120
Here I am, Miss.

30:08.750 --> 30:09.350
Go, puppy.

30:17.600 --> 30:18.660
They went that way.

30:19.110 --> 30:19.840
Are you sure?

30:20.160 --> 30:21.090
Is it confirmed?

30:21.110 --> 30:21.650
Rest assured.

30:21.650 --> 30:23.980
The scent lingers within the nearby 10 li.

30:27.080 --> 30:27.720
Go!

30:52.710 --> 30:53.960
[Susha Kingdom's Feng Battalion,
Song Cheng]

30:53.550 --> 30:54.410
Your Highness.

30:54.510 --> 30:55.400
What did you find?

30:55.400 --> 30:56.590
I finally found traces of them

30:56.590 --> 30:57.510
after spending 7 days and nights

30:57.510 --> 30:58.640
studying and tracking trails.

30:58.640 --> 31:00.040
This way, Your Highness.

31:03.680 --> 31:04.540
Your Highness.

31:05.640 --> 31:07.270
There's a jumble of footprints here.

31:07.270 --> 31:08.200
At least dozens of people

31:08.200 --> 31:09.660
gathered here last night.

31:10.240 --> 31:11.240
Your Highness, look here.

31:11.240 --> 31:11.960
But...

31:12.510 --> 31:13.970
what can these footprints

31:14.160 --> 31:15.160
possibly tell us?

31:16.680 --> 31:17.260
Song Cheng

31:17.260 --> 31:18.590
is a top-class tracker.

31:19.070 --> 31:21.110
He used to be a constable
at the Court of Judicial Review.

31:21.110 --> 31:22.030
Then His Highness recruited him

31:22.030 --> 31:22.830
into the army.

31:23.310 --> 31:24.840
He had a nickname back then—

31:25.070 --> 31:26.670
the Clairvoyant Constable.

31:26.830 --> 31:28.110
With just his keen eyes,

31:28.110 --> 31:29.440
he can distinguish foes from friends

31:29.440 --> 31:31.270
by analyzing footprints on a battlefield

31:31.270 --> 31:33.270
where a thousand people have stood.

31:33.790 --> 31:34.650
Your Highness,

31:34.920 --> 31:35.450
this way.

31:38.070 --> 31:40.270
The footprints extend to this very spot

31:40.830 --> 31:41.830
and split up here.

31:44.960 --> 31:46.420
If my judgment is correct,

31:46.790 --> 31:48.390
those people separated here

31:48.480 --> 31:49.080
in order to

31:49.240 --> 31:50.270
set an ambush.

31:50.790 --> 31:51.650
Your Highness,

31:51.880 --> 31:53.080
we'd better stop here

31:53.350 --> 31:54.680
to avoid alerting them.

32:00.750 --> 32:01.280
Yun Fang,

32:02.070 --> 32:04.070
if I'm not mistaken, anyone who is to

32:04.200 --> 32:04.880
reach Yujing

32:04.880 --> 32:06.830
from the Capital Garrison
must take this road.

32:06.830 --> 32:07.630
That's right.

32:09.030 --> 32:11.290
Xia Jingshi has indeed fled from Yujing,

32:11.510 --> 32:13.440
but his death camp still stays put.

32:14.030 --> 32:14.590
These people

32:14.590 --> 32:16.120
are all skilled assassins.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.350
Their mission must be

32:17.350 --> 32:19.080
about assassinating someone.

32:20.640 --> 32:22.170
Hou Jing the Minister of War

32:22.270 --> 32:22.720
left for

32:22.720 --> 32:25.200
the Capital Garrison a few days ago
for an inspection.

32:25.200 --> 32:26.860
When will he return to Yujing?

32:27.240 --> 32:28.880
The estimated time of arrival...

32:28.880 --> 32:30.080
is tomorrow morning.

32:30.480 --> 32:31.680
Tomorrow morning...

32:33.550 --> 32:35.410
They're targeting Minister Hou!

32:37.510 --> 32:38.970
We're running out of time.

32:58.640 --> 32:59.640
This is the place.

33:00.430 --> 33:00.930
[Murong Residence]

33:01.210 --> 33:02.050
[Murong Residence]

33:02.340 --> 33:05.490
[Murong Residence]

33:07.030 --> 33:08.090
Murong Residence?

33:11.640 --> 33:12.440
You failed?

33:14.510 --> 33:15.770
Fu Yixiao set up a trap.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.410
She's still in Yujing City?

33:21.510 --> 33:22.510
That explains it.

33:23.110 --> 33:24.910
She must've tracked down Ruyan.

33:26.030 --> 33:26.690
Why don't we

33:27.200 --> 33:29.060
find a way to eliminate Fu Yixiao?

33:35.200 --> 33:36.730
You two are no match for her.

33:37.750 --> 33:38.750
Did she find you out?

33:38.750 --> 33:40.080
We took several detours

33:40.160 --> 33:41.070
and made sure no one

33:41.070 --> 33:43.930
was following
before we came back to Your Lordship.

33:44.110 --> 33:45.170
You were found out.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.590
We're ready to be punished

33:48.590 --> 33:50.440
for failing the task, Your Lordship.

33:50.440 --> 33:51.750
The cat is out of the bag.

33:51.750 --> 33:53.550
There's no point punishing you.

33:53.960 --> 33:55.960
Does Your Lordship have a plan then?

34:03.610 --> 34:07.500
[Wutong Mansion]

34:21.070 --> 34:21.880
Miss Yixiao?

34:33.440 --> 34:34.110
Shouldn't you be

34:34.110 --> 34:35.320
at Zhengnian Villa now?

34:35.320 --> 34:37.380
You came back without telling Suige?

34:39.480 --> 34:40.139
I get it.

34:40.429 --> 34:42.230
You must've missed him too much.

34:42.570 --> 34:43.320
In recent days,

34:43.320 --> 34:44.550
His Majesty's serious condition.

34:44.550 --> 34:45.580
has been upsetting him.

34:45.580 --> 34:46.320
I'm glad you're back.

34:46.320 --> 34:47.780
I hope you can comfort him.

35:00.800 --> 35:01.440
It seems

35:01.440 --> 35:03.170
Ruyan has told you everything.

35:04.070 --> 35:05.070
Aren't you tired?

35:05.800 --> 35:06.630
How am I not?

35:07.190 --> 35:08.360
Then drop the act.

35:08.920 --> 35:09.520
I happen to

35:10.070 --> 35:11.730
have a question for you today.

35:12.150 --> 35:13.030
Feng Suige considers you

35:13.030 --> 35:14.230
his best friend.

35:14.710 --> 35:16.170
Why do you have to hurt him?

35:19.030 --> 35:19.550
What?

35:20.400 --> 35:21.930
You don't want to talk here?

35:21.960 --> 35:23.090
Then let's go inside

35:23.840 --> 35:25.570
and talk in front of Feng Suige.

35:27.360 --> 35:28.150
Is it what you want,

35:28.150 --> 35:30.190
to turn me and him against each other?

35:30.190 --> 35:31.510
Am I turning you two

35:31.550 --> 35:32.350
into enemies,

35:32.630 --> 35:34.510
or are you feeling bad
about betraying him?

35:34.510 --> 35:35.880
Why are you colluding

35:36.110 --> 35:37.150
with Xia Jingshi?

35:37.710 --> 35:38.440
Don't worry.

35:39.030 --> 35:40.110
Nothing I do

35:40.760 --> 35:42.420
will cause harm to Feng Suige.

35:42.880 --> 35:44.320
In the Battle of Pingling,

35:44.320 --> 35:45.230
if I hadn't shot Feng Suige

35:45.230 --> 35:46.630
and knocked him off his horse,

35:46.630 --> 35:48.000
he would've entered Zhennan Pass

35:48.000 --> 35:49.010
and died there.

35:49.150 --> 35:50.670
Do you expect me to believe what you said,

35:50.670 --> 35:51.960
that you wouldn't harm him?

35:51.960 --> 35:53.510
If I truly wanted to kill him,

35:53.510 --> 35:55.190
I could have it done in many ways.

35:55.190 --> 35:56.720
He never guards against me.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.280
Answer me.

35:58.880 --> 36:00.280
What exactly do you want?

36:01.840 --> 36:02.740
Be patient.

36:03.320 --> 36:04.650
You'll see soon enough.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.800
Aren't you afraid I'll tell

36:07.030 --> 36:08.560
Feng Suige the whole truth?

36:09.000 --> 36:09.800
Of course I am.

36:10.870 --> 36:12.670
Why else would I be waiting here?

36:13.070 --> 36:13.760
You can tell him

36:13.760 --> 36:15.420
what I'm really like anytime.

36:15.920 --> 36:16.980
But you should know

36:17.400 --> 36:18.400
that I'm not alone.

36:18.400 --> 36:19.590
I'm only part of a team.

36:19.590 --> 36:20.720
If my cover is blown,

36:20.920 --> 36:22.180
my plan will be executed
ahead of schedule.

36:22.180 --> 36:26.070
[Wutong Mansion]

36:22.480 --> 36:23.680
Let me put it this way.

36:24.070 --> 36:24.710
The moment you step

36:24.710 --> 36:26.370
into Feng Suige's residence,

36:26.480 --> 36:27.800
someone in the imperial palace

36:27.800 --> 36:28.960
will jeopardize His Majesty's life.

36:28.960 --> 36:29.760
Just imagine.

36:30.190 --> 36:31.670
What will happen to Feng Suige,

36:31.670 --> 36:33.090
if His Majesty dies?

36:34.800 --> 36:36.000
He'll not only suffer the pain

36:36.000 --> 36:37.600
of losing his father, right?

36:41.840 --> 36:42.840
He'll also lose

36:42.840 --> 36:44.190
everything he owns now,

36:46.400 --> 36:48.070
including his life.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.170
Are you threatening me?

37:01.440 --> 37:02.700
You've taken it wrong.

37:03.150 --> 37:04.090
In the past,

37:04.150 --> 37:05.170
I cherished my friendship

37:05.170 --> 37:06.100
with Feng Suige,

37:06.150 --> 37:06.960
so I was reluctant to do anything

37:06.960 --> 37:08.360
that could harm his life.

37:09.070 --> 37:10.670
But if you ever blow my cover,

37:10.920 --> 37:11.550
I'll have to

37:11.550 --> 37:13.350
forsake my friendship with him.

37:13.630 --> 37:14.440
In that case,

37:15.000 --> 37:15.710
I'll have no reason

37:15.710 --> 37:16.840
to hold myself back.

37:18.280 --> 37:20.740
Feng Suige's life
is in the palm of your hand.

37:28.630 --> 37:29.670
I can promise you

37:29.800 --> 37:31.660
that whatever happens in the end,

37:32.070 --> 37:33.200
I'll spare his life.

37:35.800 --> 37:36.660
How about that?

37:36.760 --> 37:38.360
You can make your choice now.

37:44.230 --> 37:44.960
You know what?

37:44.960 --> 37:46.290
I can kill you right now!

37:47.550 --> 37:48.800
When whistling arrows are shot,

37:48.680 --> 37:52.310
[Wutong Mansion]

37:49.000 --> 37:50.200
the emperor will die,

37:50.280 --> 37:51.740
and Susha will be in chaos.

38:01.640 --> 38:03.500
Though you care about Feng Suige,

38:03.980 --> 38:05.980
you must refrain acting on impulse.

38:25.420 --> 38:27.110
[Log of City's Defenses]

38:51.910 --> 38:52.690
Charge!

39:28.230 --> 39:29.070
Take the shortcut!

39:29.070 --> 39:29.550
Let's go!

39:29.550 --> 39:30.000
Yes!

39:40.440 --> 39:41.590
My Lord, run!

39:57.960 --> 39:58.760
Go after them!

40:13.960 --> 40:14.820
Go check it out.

40:15.070 --> 40:15.590
Yes!

40:24.070 --> 40:24.930
Your Highness!

40:25.000 --> 40:26.400
Minister Hou is not here!

40:37.190 --> 40:38.050
Your Highness,

40:38.150 --> 40:39.210
they went that way.

40:41.510 --> 40:43.110
Those people came prepared.

40:43.360 --> 40:44.190
When the fight starts,

40:44.190 --> 40:45.520
stay hidden somewhere.

40:45.800 --> 40:47.190
If an enemy soldier escapes,

40:47.190 --> 40:48.070
you must follow him

40:48.070 --> 40:49.070
to their hideout.

40:49.360 --> 40:49.880
Got it!

40:58.070 --> 40:58.870
Minister Hou!

41:00.030 --> 41:01.090
-My Lord!
-My Lord!

41:02.230 --> 41:02.710
My Lord!

41:03.400 --> 41:04.130
Are you alright, My Lord?

41:04.130 --> 41:06.000
The arrow was dipped in poison.

41:06.030 --> 41:07.440
-Let's go.
-Move!

41:24.320 --> 41:25.240
Who...

41:25.360 --> 41:26.510
are you?

41:43.230 --> 41:44.420
Kill them all!

42:38.000 --> 42:38.760
Feng Suige,

42:39.440 --> 42:41.110
though you're here today,

42:41.670 --> 42:43.510
you can't save Hou Jing's life.

42:44.110 --> 42:45.510
The Jinxiu death camp...

42:46.440 --> 42:47.760
You must be Wu Ying.

42:48.960 --> 42:50.660
I guess Yixiao keeps

42:51.050 --> 42:52.770
no secret from you.

42:53.140 --> 42:54.070
This is perfect.

42:54.760 --> 42:55.710
Today,

42:56.320 --> 42:58.930
it's time we ended all the feuds.

42:58.950 --> 43:00.610
Your Highness must be joking.

43:01.190 --> 43:03.120
How are there any feuds between us?

43:03.760 --> 43:05.760
If I say there are, there must be.

43:26.320 --> 43:26.960
Chief!

43:27.120 --> 43:27.710
Chief!

43:48.960 --> 43:50.190
Your Highness,
I'll go after them with others.

43:50.190 --> 43:51.190
Give it some time.

43:54.070 --> 43:54.930
Your Highness!

43:55.760 --> 43:57.070
Minister Hou was shot in the back.

43:57.070 --> 43:58.030
Though it's not a vital spot,

43:58.030 --> 44:00.280
I'm afraid there might be poison
on the arrow.

44:00.280 --> 44:01.440
On our way back to the capital,

44:01.440 --> 44:02.840
who knows what dangers are lying ahead.

44:02.840 --> 44:03.760
Young Mistress Ling

44:03.760 --> 44:05.360
should've arrived
at Zhengnian Villa by now.

44:05.360 --> 44:05.960
Bring Minister Hou there

44:05.960 --> 44:06.890
for treatment.

44:07.070 --> 44:07.590
Got it.
